<h1>API</h1>
<p>Integrate BlogApp into your applications with our REST API.</p>
<p>Our v1 endpoints support posts, users, and authentication. Base URL: <code>/api/v1</code></p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>GET /api/v1/posts</strong> — List published posts</li>
  <li><strong>GET /api/v1/posts/:id</strong> — Fetch a single post</li>
  <li><strong>POST /api/v1/login</strong> — Authenticate and receive a token</li>
  <li><strong>GET /api/v1/users</strong> — List users</li>
</ul>
<p>Contact us for API keys and rate limit details.</p>
